# OpenCode iOS port patch -- 0002
# Title: Node 22.9 fallbacks for module.registerHooks and --experimental-sqlite
# Upstream: anomalyco/opencode @ e8238bae9b807b72ecfc75afd3a9fe2e6b07b944 (v2.2.5)
# Files: packages/cli/src/util/process.ts
#        packages/plugin/src/source.node.ts
#        packages/util/src/runtime/import.node.ts
# Why: Node 22.9 predates module.registerHooks (added in Node 22.15). A named ESM import
#      of a missing builtin export throws a SyntaxError at module link time, before any
#      try/catch can run, and the single-file Rollup bundle evaluates these modules at
#      startup. Use a namespace import plus a guarded call; without the hook, plugin
#      package/local entrypoints still load but live reload of a local plugin's relative
#      import graph degrades, and directory-based plugin resolution falls back to a
#      CommonJS resolve anchored at the plugin directory.
#      Also propagate --experimental-sqlite to self-spawned server children: on Node 22.9
#      node:sqlite requires the flag, so without it every command that starts the server
#      fails with ERR_UNKNOWN_BUILTIN_MODULE.
# Test: node --experimental-sqlite opencode.mjs models / auth list / session list on
#       stock Node 22.9.0 (these start the server child process).
# Status: required for the iPhoneOS runtime; safe on Node 24/26 (flag accepted, hook present).

diff --git a/packages/cli/src/util/process.ts b/packages/cli/src/util/process.ts
index 4721a12..3e9078a 100644
--- a/packages/cli/src/util/process.ts
+++ b/packages/cli/src/util/process.ts
@@ -18,6 +18,11 @@ function nodeFlags() {
     if (
       arg === "--experimental-ffi" ||
       arg === "--use-system-ca" ||
+      // iPhoneOS ships Node 22.9 where node:sqlite requires this flag. Child
+      // server processes are spawned with process.execPath and must receive it
+      // too, otherwise the server exits with ERR_UNKNOWN_BUILTIN_MODULE on
+      // every command that starts it. Newer Node lines accept the flag.
+      arg === "--experimental-sqlite" ||
       arg === "--enable-source-maps" ||
       arg === "--no-addons"
     )
